      "id": "jfbvztvu",
      "name": "Overview",
      "expanded": false,
      "text": "Overview\n\nYou enter Shellspace.\n\nIn there you encounter two factions:\n\n* RMRF\n    This group seems to be fighting against the corporate 'bad guys' that have taken over Shellspace.\n    But in actuality they are the ones who are facilitating the meat space deaths, and claiming Retrograde is doing it.\n\n\n* Retrograde\n    This is a group of elite Shellspace hackers, in the deeper levels of the\n    virtual world. They are secretly fighting RMRF, attempting to bring Shellspace\n    back to its 'wild west' / 'darkweb' status.\n",
      "children": [
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "z34fhnrk",
      "name": "Who is Perihelion?",
      "expanded": true,
      "text": "Who is Perihelion?\n\n- He is you own father.",
      "children": [
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "5rlxxeur",
      "name": "Who is Xavier?",
      "expanded": true,
      "text": "Who is Xavier?\n\nHe is your father's hacker.",
      "children": [
      ]
    }
    ]
  },
