          "expanded": false,
          "text": "Plot:\n\n* Enter Shellspace.\n* Learn about the _House Alarm_.\n* Encounter the name Perihelion (_Who is Perihelion?_)\n* Encounter the phrase \"Go Deeper\".\n* USB to get to Shellspace.\n* Discover the password: R3dF0x1.\n    #todo : What is the pwd for?\n",
